[h]oardDB [app]> set extjson on
extjson is now on for documents printed from now on.
[h]oardDB [app]> db.User["ada"].get()
{"Age": 36, "Joined": {"$date":"2024-08-24T04:57:21.295Z"}, "Name": "Ada", "_id_": "ada"}
[h]oardDB [app]> set pretty on
pretty is now on for documents printed from now on.
[h]oardDB [app]> db.User.list()
{
  "Age": 36,
  "Joined": {
    "$date": "2024-08-24T04:57:21.295Z"
  },
  "Name": "Ada",
  "_id_": "ada"
}
[h]oardDB [app]> set extjson off
extjson is now off for documents printed from now on.
[h]oardDB [app]> db.User["ada"].get()
{
  "Age": 36,
  "Joined": "2024-08-24T04:57:21.295Z",
  "Name": "Ada",
  "_id_": "ada"
}
